{"title": "Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion", "pageid": 21421, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie_Battalion", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Actions", "Bugs", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp/300px-Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp/300px-Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Animate_Dead_Zombie.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 necromancy spell</a>. This spell is a higher level version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/38px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/50px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\">Animate Dead: Zombie</a> that can summon 3 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/25px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/38px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/50px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zombies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/25px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\">Zombies</a> instead of 1. Accordingly, the user must also target 3 corpses for this instead of 1.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Create 3 zombies that specialise in melee combat. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">The targets must be Medium or Small corpses.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/38px-Party_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/50px-Party_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Targets: 3 Medium or Small corpses\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Party_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Targets: 3 Medium or Small corpses</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Creature:_Zombie_.28Animate_Dead.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\"> Creature: Zombie (Animate Dead) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/120px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp, /w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png/120px-Portrait_Zombie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Zombie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>6</span></b></div> <span>(-2)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>3</span></b></div> <span>(-4)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>6</span></b></div> <span>(-2)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">CHA</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>5</span></b>\n<b></b></div><b> <span>(-3)</span></b>\n</td>\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/36px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/48px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Duration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Until long rest</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>22</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>8</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Animate_Dead_Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Animate Dead Zombie)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/60px-Slam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/80px-Slam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Animate_Dead_Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Animate Dead Zombie)\">Slam</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Hit a target with your bare fists and infect it with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawling Gnaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\">Crawling Gnaw</a></span>. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Animate Dead</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This zombie applies a condition called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawling Gnaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)\" title=\"Crawling Gnaw (Condition)\">Crawling Gnaw</a>. If an enemy is killed while having this condition, a <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Newborn Zombie\">Newborn Zombie</a> is automatically spawned from their corpse.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, zombies summoned by a <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_School\" title=\"Necromancy School\">Necromancy School</a> wizard with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Undead_Thralls:_Better_Summons\" title=\"Undead Thralls: Better Summons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp/20px-Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp/30px-Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp/40px-Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Undead Thralls: Better Summons\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp/20px-Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Undead_Thralls_Better_Summons_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Undead_Thralls:_Better_Summons\" title=\"Undead Thralls: Better Summons\">Undead Thralls: Better Summons</a>, while affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rejuvenating_Miasma_(Condition)\" title=\"Rejuvenating Miasma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rejuvenating Miasma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rejuvenating_Miasma_(Condition)\" title=\"Rejuvenating Miasma (Condition)\">Rejuvenating Miasma</a>, fail to spawn unless a corpse is targeted, wasting the spell slot used to cast Animate Dead.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewP